      "excerpt": "Discover how calming botanicals like Calendula fit into a simple, gentle daily skin care routine.",
      "content": "<p>Healthy skin usually starts with simple habits: gentle cleansing, enough water, sun protection and a little patience. Botanicals such as Calendula can be a useful addition.<\/p><h2>Why Calendula?<\/h2><p>Calendula officinalis, or marigold, has a long history of use in natural skin care. It is commonly included in ointments for minor cuts, dry patches and irritated skin.<\/p><h2>A gentle routine<\/h2><ul><li>Cleanse with lukewarm water and a mild cleanser.<\/li><li>Pat dry — never rub harshly.<\/li><li>Apply a thin layer of a soothing ointment where needed.<\/li><li>Use a simple moisturiser and sunscreen during the day.<\/li><\/ul><p>Persistent rashes, itching or acne deserve a proper consultation. Natural care works best when it is matched to your skin.<\/p>"
